<title>SPAIN: Eridania buys Tabacalera's 9.66 pct in Koipe.</title>
<headline>Eridania buys Tabacalera's 9.66 pct in Koipe.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eridania Beghin-Say said on Tuesday it has acquired Spain's Tabacalera 's 9.66 percent stake in olive oil group Koipe.</p>
<p>This is the equivalent of 625,829 shares, bought via Eridania's subsidiary Medeol SA, bringing the total stake in Koipe to 75.95 percent.</p>
<p>No price was specified.</p>
<p>Tabacalera was unavailable for comment.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
